# 08. Project Demonstration

## Project Title
Pocket Smart AI – Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Demonstration Steps

### Step 1
Open the Pocket Smart AI application.

### Step 2
Enter the user's monthly income.

### Step 3
Enter daily or monthly expenses.

### Step 4
Select the appropriate expense category.

### Step 5
Set the monthly budget limit.

### Step 6
The system calculates the total expenses.

### Step 7
The system displays the remaining balance.

### Step 8
AI analyzes the user's spending pattern.

### Step 9
The system provides budget recommendations.

## Demonstration Result
Pocket Smart AI helps users understand their spending habits, manage their budget, and receive useful recommendations through an AI-based system.
